<body id=3D"artifacts-component-root-html">
<header>
<h1>China Essentials for Anna</h1>
<p>Two weeks =C2=B7 Beijing, Shanghai &amp; more =C2=B7 Australian passport=
 =C2=B7 Samsung phone<br>Updated 21 November 2026</p>
</header>
<nav>
<a href=3D"https://www.claudeusercontent.com/?domain=3Dclaude.ai&amp;parent=
Origin=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fclaude.ai&amp;errorReportingMode=3Dparent&amp;format=
