omain=3Dclaude.ai&amp;parentOrigin=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fclaude.ai&amp;errorRepor=
tingMode=3Dparent&amp;formattedSpreadsheets=3Dtrue&amp;theme=3Dlight&amp;co=
ntentType=3Dtext%2Fhtml#pay">Paying</a><a href=3D"https://www.claudeusercon=
